This product includes no copies of BombVault source. The public
BombVault README (junkerderprovinz/bombvault, AGPL-3.0) inspired
the interaction model: one list of entries, Overview / Anomalies /
Backups / Restore / Settings, dump-first databases, off-site copy
of unique packs, restore proofs, and self-backup of settings.

Kopia is Apache-2.0. restic is BSD-2-Clause. Borg is BSD-3-Clause.
Those binaries are optional runtime dependencies, executed as
subprocesses, not linked into this program.
